---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Who I am and what this site is for."
	pubDate={new Date('August 28 2026')}
>
	<p>
		I'm Aiden Ferrante, a data science master's student. I learn best by building things and
		explaining them, so this site does double duty: it's my public notebook and my portfolio.
	</p>

	<p>Two kinds of posts land here:</p>

	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Video companions</strong> — I make YouTube videos working through math, AI, and
			software concepts from first principles, in my own words. Each video gets a written version
			here with the details that don't fit on screen.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Essays</strong> — opinions and analysis on what's happening in AI and software,
			argued from evidence rather than vibes.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		Outside of writing, I build a lot: agentic AI systems, financial data tooling, games, and the
		self-hosted infrastructure that runs it all. Most of it lives on
		<a href="https://github.com/Aiden-Ferrante">my GitHub</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're hiring, collaborating, or just want to argue about something I wrote —
		<a href="mailto:ferranteaiden6@gmail.com">email me</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
